    <selectionEntry id="10bc-3429-577b-63f8" name="Agonizer" publicationId="d740d6ea--pubN65554" page="84" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="model">
      <constraints>
        <constraint field="selections" scope="force" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="false" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" id="maxInForce" type="max"/>
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile id="2e3c-c1ca-cb9e-488f" name="Agonizer" hidden="false" typeId="54726f6f70657223232344415441232323" typeName="Trooper">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="SPD" typeId="5.3504423232344415e+25">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="STR" typeId="5.354522323234442e+25">7</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="MAT" typeId="4d415423232344415441232323">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="RAT" typeId="5.2415423232344416e+25">1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="DEF" typeId="4.445462323234441e+25">13</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="ARM" typeId="41524d23232344415441232323">16</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="CMD" typeId="434d4423232344415441232323">6</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Damage" typeId="44616d61676523232344415441232323">8</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="f9a8-a879-7774-24d3" name="Skorne Solo" hidden="false"/>
        <rule id="df5c-9214-ace6-2b08" name="Agonies" hidden="false">
          <description>Once during its activation, this model can spend 1 fury point to use one of the following effects. Enemy models suffer these effects while within 4&quot; of this model +1&quot; per fury point on it. These effects lasts for one round.
- Gnawing Pain - Affected enemy warbeasts suffer -2 to their damage rolls.
- Maddening - Affected enemy warbeasts suffer -2 THR.
- Spiritual Affliction - Affected enemy warbeasts lose their animi. Affected enemy warjacks lose the Arc Node advantage and cannot be allocated focus.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="cfe0-be62-f096-67ed" name="Fury Bank" hidden="false">
          <description>While this model is in a friendly warlock&apos;s control area during the warlock&apos;s activation, the warlock can move fury points from himself to this model. This model can have up to 5 fury points at a time. While this model is in a friendly Faction warlock&apos;s control area, the warlock can leach fury from this model as if it were a warbeast.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink id="4097-3a52-3205-69d1" hidden="false" targetId="1825eb84-75bc-45d1-075a-73923524097d" type="rule" name="Fearless"/>
      </infoLinks>
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink id="10bc-3429-577b-63f8-536f6c6f23232344415441232323" hidden="false" targetId="536f6c6f23232344415441232323" primary="true" name="Solo"/>
      </categoryLinks>
      <costs>
        <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="2"/>
      </costs>
    </selectionEntry>
