          <rules>
            <rule id="11a2-6f2b-5709-cc7f" name="Heart Stopper: Grave Door" publicationId="d740d6ea--pubN68778" page="54" hidden="false">
              <description>When a living enemy model is boxed by this attack, it heals 1 damage point. For the rest of the turn, this model can channel spells through the enemy model if it is in this model&apos;s control area and is not engaged. At the end of the turn, the enemy model is destroyed.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
