        <rule id="b589-205c-1eb1-ffe6" name="Craft Talisman (* Action)" hidden="false">
          <description>RNG 3. Target friendly Faction warlock. If the warlock is in range, when he casts a spell and is its point of origin, the spell gain s+2 RNG. Spells with RNG SEKF, SP, or CTRL are not affected. Craft Talisman lasts for one turn.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="b939-44b8-eeb2-74a6" name="Primal Magic" hidden="false">
          <description>This model can use the animus of any friendly Faction warbeast in its command range as if the animus were its own.</description>
