          <description>If one or more friendly Faction warrior models were destroyed or removed from play by enemy attacks while within 5&quot; of this model during your opponent&apos;s last turn, after resolving continuous effects during your Maintenance Phase, this model can make a full advance followed by one normal melee attack.</description>
