        <rule id="97f5-2d3c-f08b-e2b0" name="Drag Below" hidden="false">
          <description>During this model&apos;s activation, immediately after resolving an attack in which it boxed a living enemy model, this model can use Drag Below. The boxed model is removed from play and this model can immediately make a full advance and then perform a Dig In special action, then its activation ends.</description>
