        <rule id="c672-f50b-53dc-953f" name="Brace for Impact" hidden="false">
          <description>When this model is slammed, reduce the slam distance rolled by 3. If the total slam distance is 0 or less, this model is not knocked down. This model is not knocked down when it suffers collateral damage.</description>
        </rule>
