    <selectionEntry id="a108-1ef8-8196-d21e" name="Tyrant Xerxis" publicationId="d740d6ea--pubN65554" page="44" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="model">
      <constraints>
        <constraint field="selections" scope="force" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="false" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" id="maxInForce" type="max"/>
        <constraint field="selections" scope="roster" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="false" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" id="maxInRoster" type="max"/>
      </constraints>
      <rules>
        <rule id="5321-461d-b78f-0074" name="Skorne Warlock" hidden="false"/>
        <rule id="70bd-d505-5fae-c192" name="Feat: Total Annihilation" hidden="false">
          <description>While in Xerxis&apos; control area, friendly Faction models gain an additional die on their melee damage rolls. While in Xerxis&apos; control area and B2B with another friendly Faction model, friendly Faction models gain +2 ARM. Total Annihilation lasts for one round.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="995a-9b5d-4c51-e4f9" name="Battle Plan" hidden="false">
          <description>During this model&apos;s activation, it can use one of the following plans. A friendly Faction model/unit can be affected by ony one plan each turn.
- Overcome - RGN 5. Target friendly Faction warrior model/unit. If the model/unit is in range, it gains Pathfinder for one turn.
- Press Forward - RNG 5. Target friendly fAction warrior model/unit. If the model/unit is in range, it gains +2 SPD when making a full advance this turn.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink id="8b31-51bf-0d18-1a6d" hidden="false" targetId="046b-96d6-b300-3010" type="rule" name="Martial Discipline"/>
        <infoLink id="a33c-037a-bdce-d40c" hidden="false" targetId="5bde-ece7-8026-ec2d" type="rule" name="Overtake"/>
      </infoLinks>
