      <rules>
        <rule id="ebea-809c-01ad-6279" name="Bone Shaker" hidden="false">
          <description>When this spell boxes a living or undead non-warcaster, non-warlock enemy warrior model, you can immediately make a full advance with the enemy model followed by a normal melee attack, then the boxed model is removed from play. The boxed model cannot be targeted by free strikes during this movement.</description>
        </rule>
